WEBVTT

00:04:28.316 --> 00:04:30.276
life-threatening arrhythmias,

00:04:30.276 --> 00:04:31.636
even death.

00:04:31.676 --> 00:04:37.076
For example, the husband
of an elderly patient of mine

00:04:37.116 --> 00:04:38.676
had died recently.

00:04:39.356 --> 00:04:42.676
She was sad, of course, but accepting.

00:04:43.556 --> 00:04:45.436
Maybe even a bit relieved.

00:04:45.476 --> 00:04:48.076
It had been a very long illness;
he'd had dementia.

00:04:48.116 --> 00:04:51.676
But a week after the funeral,
she looked at his picture

00:04:52.476 --> 00:04:53.876
and became tearful.

00:04:54.796 --> 00:04:59.876
And then she developed chest pain,
and with it, came shortness of breath,

00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:02.916
distended neck veins, a sweaty brow,